<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador October consumer price inflation by sector.</title>
<headline>Ecuador October consumer price inflation by sector.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador's consumer price inflation by sector was as follows in October, the National Statistics and Census Institute said Thursday:</p>
<p>    Food				     1.92 pct</p>
<p>    Clothing				 1.84 pct</p>
<p>    Housing				  1.55 pct</p>
<p>    Others				   1.01 pct</p>
<p>    Total				    1.55 pct</p>
<p>-- Gustavo Oviedo, Quito Newsroom, 5932 258433</p>
</text>
